&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Workplace Operations Program Manager to help run the heart of our San Francisco HQ. This role is equal parts operational excellence and people-first thinking — you&#39;ll keep the office running smoothly day-to-day while also designing the programs and experiences that make our workplace somewhere people genuinely love to be. If you&#39;re someone who finds joy in the details, thrives in a fast-paced environment, and cares deeply about creating a welcoming, inclusive space, we&#39;d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This person will report to the Sr. Director, Workplace&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilities &amp;amp; Office Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the day-to-day physical operation of the office — including morning restocking of kitchens, common areas, and supplies; beverage and fridge management; shower room upkeep; reception; mailroom operations; and coffee machine maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage food, beverage, and lunch service programs end-to-end, including vendor relationships, employee messaging, usage monitoring, and budget alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee office supply ordering, backstock management, and financial oversight across facilities operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Space Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage vendor relationships and service delivery across HQ — including janitorial, Creative Plant, Cintas, and other contractors — holding partners accountable to SLAs and presenting optimization recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the desk residency program, including strategy, team seating assignments, space allocation, and day-to-day tracking and communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce parking garage policies and manage access control, including credential issuance, audits, and coordination with Security on compliance and escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing budgets and tracking expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Experience &amp;amp; Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement employee engagement programs that strengthen company culture and create moments of surprise and delight that reflect our values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own daily employee support — responding to tickets, serving as an approachable resource, and continuously evolving our operations playbook to ensure a safe, inclusive environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policy, Process &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and iterate workplace policies and processes that maximize operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with partners across People, IT, Facilities, Security, and Finance, clearly communicating complex concepts and adjusting messaging based on stakeholder needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Internal Events, Employee Experience, and other cross-functional teams to execute company events including all-hands and onsites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years experience in workplace operations, facilities management, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong vendor management skills with demonstrated ability to hold partners accountable to SLAs and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing space planning, seating programs, or desk residency initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with annual planning, budgets, and tracking expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to simplify the complex and adapt your message to any audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, solutions-oriented mindset with strong attention to detail and the ability to manage multiple priorities with minimal guidanceA genuine passion for creating inclusive, people-first workplace experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates must reside in or be willing to relocate to the San Francisco Bay Area (Alameda, Contra Costa, Marin, Napa, San Francisco, San Mateo, Santa Clara, Solano, and Sonoma counties). Relocation assistance may be available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For this role, the Hiring Manager would like folks to be in the office 4 days a week.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual US base salary range for this full-time position is&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;$124,000 - $139,500 + equity + benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discord is committed to inclusion and providing reasonable accommodations during the interview process. &lt;/strong&gt;We want you to feel set up for success, so if you are in need of reasonable accommodations, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please see our Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy for details regarding Discord’s collection and usage of personal information relating to the application and recruitment process by clicking&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/terms/applicant-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;HERE.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
